    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d416">

                <pb facs="0595" n="519" xml:id="pg519"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">611.6531/133</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Italian Embassy to the
                            Department of State</hi></head>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Aide-Mémoire</hi></p>
                <p>The Italian Government have appreciated the communication made to them by the
                    Government of the United States through the memorandum of the Department of
                    State under date of January 7th, 1935 and are glad to accept the proposal to
                    enter upon trade negotiations between Italy and the United States.</p>
                <p>The Italian Government entertain the hope that such negotiations will lead to a
                    conciliation of the respective views even on the points now at variance on
                    certain questions of principle, and that they will result into an agreement
                    satisfactory to both Governments.</p>
                <p>According to the suggestion offered verbally by the Assistant [Secretary] of
                    State, Mr. Sayre, to Ambassador Rosso, the Italian Government will make public
                    announcement of the forthcoming negotiations on Wednesday, January 16th,
                    indicating that the actual negotiations will start on or about the 1st of
                    May.</p>
                <p>The names of the Italian Delegates in charge of these negotiations will be
                    communicated in due course.</p>
                <closer>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-left">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi>
                        </placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1935-01-12">January 12,
                            1935</date>.</dateline>
                </closer>
            </div>
